:: Bailey Stalk Widgets [widget]

<<widget "streetbaileyangry">>
	<<endevent>>
	<<set $weekly.streetBailey to true>>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].skills to {athletics: random(850, 1600), security: random(750, 1500)}>>
	You spot Bailey across the street, talking to someone beside a car. <<He>> holds a phone in one hand and gestures towards the car with the other, too occupied to notice you.
	<br><br>
	
	Your rent is overdue.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Approach Bailey|Street Bailey Angry]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>>
	<<link [[Hide (0:25)|Street Bailey Angry Hide]]>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>><<pass 25>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Run|Street Stalk Run Bailey]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>


:: Street Bailey Angry
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You cross the street while Bailey is still talking. <<He>> notices you before you reach <<him>>, stops gesturing towards the car, and pockets <<his>> phone as <<he>> turns away from the other person.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	"There you are." <<He>> catches your upper arm and turns you towards the orphanage. "Let's go." <<He>> starts walking before you can answer, keeping hold of you as you fall into step.
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
	"You." <<His>> jaw tightens. "You owe me. Walk. Now." <<He>> grabs your arm and yanks you forward.
<<else>>
	"You owe me money," <<he>> says flatly. <<His>> hand closes on your arm. "Move."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey keeps hold of you all the way back. You have to match <<his>> pace as <<he>> leads you through the streets, and <<his>> grip only loosens once you're through the orphanage door.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
<br>


:: Street Bailey Angry Hide
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<skulduggeryuse>>
	You step out of Bailey's line of sight and press yourself close to the wall, staying still while <<his>> footsteps pass nearby. <span class="green"><<He>> doesn't notice you.</span>
	<br><br>

	You wait until the footsteps have faded before moving away from the wall and continuing on your way.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	You step out of Bailey's line of sight and press yourself close to the wall. <<He>> walks past, but the footsteps stop after only a few paces. <span class="red">When <<he>> looks back, <<hes>> staring directly towards your hiding place.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
		"I could hear you breathing." <<He>> rounds the corner. <<His>> hand finds the back of your neck. "Let's not make this difficult."
	<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
		"You think I'm blind?" <<He>> rounds the corner and grabs your arm. <<His>> grip is too tight. "Get up."
	<<else>>
		<<He>> rounds the corner. "You're not as clever as you think." <<His>> hand closes on your arm. "Let's go."
	<</if>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>

	Bailey turns you towards the orphanage and keeps hold of you as <<he>> walks you back, ignoring any attempt to slow the pace.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Street Stalk Run Bailey
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>

	<<maninit>>
	<<stalk_init>>
	<<set $combatgoal to "confront">>
	<<set $NPCList[0].bold to 10000>>
	<<set $stalk_assess to true>>
	You turn and run. <span class="pink">You are being pursued.</span>
<</if>>

<<effects>>

<<effectsman>><<man>>

<<stateman>>
<<actionsman>>

<<if $stalk_end>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Street Stalk Run Bailey Finish]]>><<if $feetaction is "confront">><<set $phase to 1>><<else>><<set $phase to 0>><</if>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Street Stalk Run Bailey Finish]]>><<set $stalk_end to "confront">><<set $phase to 0>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Street Stalk Run Bailey]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: Street Stalk Run Bailey Finish
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $stalk_end is "confront">>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		Bailey's hand closes on your arm from behind. <<His>> grip is bruising.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Bailey catches up as you slow and grabs your upper arm before you can turn away. <<He>> pulls you to a stop beside <<him>>.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<endcombat>>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

	<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
		"You ran." <<He>> sounds almost disappointed. <<He>> pulls you along with a firm grip. "Don't do that again."
	<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
		"Stupid." <<He>> yanks you forward. <<His>> jaw is tight. "You can't outrun what you owe."
	<<else>>
		"Finished?" Bailey asks, already turning you towards the orphanage. <<He>> pulls you along by the arm. "Then move."
	<</if>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">><<stress 6>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Try to pull away|Bailey Stalk Pull Away]]>><<def 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 2000 18000>><<ldom>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Submit (0:10)|Bailey Stalk Submit]]>><<pass 10>><<sub 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
	<br>
<<elseif $stalk_end is "hide">>
	You stay hidden long enough for your breathing to settle, listening for Bailey before you finally step back out. <<Hes>> nowhere in sight.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you take another moment to check the street, then continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<destinationeventend>>
<<elseif $stalk_end is "ambush">>
	<<set _physiqueTopple to random(2000, 18000)>>
	<<if $physique gte _physiqueTopple>>
		Your tackle takes Bailey off <<his>> feet, and you come down on top of <<him>> with one hand braced against <<his>> chest. <<He>> looks up at you, visibly annoyed, while you try to decide what to do before <<he>> recovers.
		<br><br>

		<<silently>><<endcombat>><</silently>>
		<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

		<<link [[Fight|Bailey Stalk Ambush Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<def 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Run|Bailey Stalk Ambush]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<def 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
		<br>
		<<if $syndromeBailey is true>>
			<<link [[Kiss Bailey, and then run|Bailey Stalk Ambush]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><</link>><<glove>><<ldom>><<kissvirginitywarning>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		Bailey stumbles into the wall when you hit <<him>>, but <<he>> regains <<his>> footing before you can get away. <<He>> grabs you by the throat and shoves you back against the wall.
		<br><br>

		Before you can recover, <<he>> catches the front of your shirt and hauls you upright. <<He>> keeps hold of the fabric as <<he>> turns you towards the orphanage.
		<br><br>

		Bailey walks you home without speaking, keeping you close enough that you cannot break away.
		<br><br>

		<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
		<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You keep running until Bailey is no longer behind you. Even after the sound of the chase has disappeared, you put more distance between you before finally slowing down.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you check behind you once, then continue on your way at a walk.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Stalk Ambush
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You bend down and kiss <<him>> before <<he>> can push you away. Bailey goes still for a moment instead of stopping you, giving you the chance to pull back first. <<takeKissVirginity "Bailey" "romantic">>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

You push yourself off Bailey and run for the street without looking back. <<His>> footsteps follow at a steady pace behind you, so you keep moving until the sound is lost among the people and traffic around you.
<br><br>

<<tearful>> you slow to a walk and move with the passing crowds instead of staying in one place. After checking behind you several times without seeing Bailey, you allow yourself to keep going. <span class="green">You have lost <<him>>, for now.</span>
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<destinationeventend>>


:: Bailey Stalk Ambush Fight
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<He>> throws you sideways and you crash into the alley wall. <<Hes>> on you before you've registered the impact. <<His>> hand fists in your hair and yanks your head back.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	"You're coming with me," <<he>> says calmly.
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
	"Stupid little shit," <<he>> hisses.
<<else>>
	"Stop wasting time," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> hauls you upright and locks one hand around your upper arm, <<his>> fingers digging in painfully whenever you fall behind. Bailey drags you out of the alley and onto the busy street, where people pass close enough to see what is happening without interfering. You keep moving because <<he>> gives you no room to stop.
<br><br>

When you reach the orphanage, Bailey pulls you through the front door and keeps hold of you until <<he>> has taken you into <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<set $baileyAmbushAdvantage to Time.days>>
<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Stalk Pull Away
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $physiqueSuccess>>
	You twist your arm sharply and <span class="green">pull free of Bailey's grip</span>. The moment <<his>> hand slips away, you put several steps between you and run before <<he>> can catch you again.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you slow to a walk. Your arm aches where <<his>> fingers were. Rent is still due tomorrow.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	You twist your arm and pull in the opposite direction, but Bailey's grip does not loosen. <<His>> fingers press harder as you struggle, sending a sharper pain through your arm until you stop trying.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>

	Bailey turns you towards the orphanage and walks you back without another word, keeping hold of you the entire way.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Stalk Submit
<<effects>><<person1>>

You stop pulling against Bailey's grip and let your arm go slack. <<He>> notices the change and turns you towards the orphanage, keeping hold of you as <<he>> starts walking.
<br><br>

You follow without resisting. Bailey says nothing on the way back, but <<he>> does not release your arm until you reach the orphanage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $bus to "home">><</link>>
<br>


:: Street Bailey Rent
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	<<He>> steers you into <<his>> office and shuts the door behind you. <<He>> doesn't let go of your arm until you're standing in front of <<his>> desk. <<He>> rounds <<his>> desk before looking at you.
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
	<<He>> shoves you through the front door and into <<his>> office. The door slams behind you. <<He>> rounds <<his>> desk and drops into the chair, jaw still tight.
<<else>>
	<<He>> steers you into <<his>> office and shuts the door behind you. <<He>> doesn't let go of your arm until you're standing in front of <<his>> desk. <<He>> rounds <<his>> desk before looking at you.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $baileydefeatedchain gte 3 or ($robinpaid is 1 and $robinStand?.selfSufficient isnot 1 and $robinromance gte 1 and $bus is "home" and $robinfirstrentfight isnot 1 and $rentTime lte -14)>>
	<<generateRole 1 0 "thug">><<generateRole 2 0 "thug">>
	A rough-looking <<person2>><<person>> and <<person3>><<person>> stand next to <<person1>><<him>>.
	The <<person2>><<person>> cracks <<his>> knuckles while the <<person3>><<person>> watches you with a grin.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileydefeatedchain gte 1>>
	<<generateRole 1 0 "thug">>
	A rough-looking <<person2>><<person>> stands next to <<person1>><<him>>.
	<<person2>><<He>> cracks <<his>> knuckles.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<rent_avery>>

<<if $babyIntros and $babyIntros.Bailey and $babyIntros.Bailey.length gt 0>>
	<<set _homeBabyRent to true>>
	<<homeBabyIntro>>
<</if>>
<<babyRent>>
/* Savings count, same as the doorstep and the street hunt: Bailey walks you to the bank if your pockets are short. */
<<set _loanSurcharge to (setup.hbsc and setup.hbsc.loanRentSurcharge ? setup.hbsc.loanRentSurcharge() : 0)>>
<<bratTaxCalc>>
<<set _rentTotal to ($rentMoney + ($babyRent or 0) + $baileyBratTax + _loanSurcharge)>>
<<if ((setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.rentPayable() : $money) + ($baileyDeposit or 0)) gte _rentTotal>>
	<<person1>>
	<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
		"You know the amount." <<He>> holds out <<his>> hand, palm up.
	<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
		"Pay me." <<He>> holds out <<his>> hand. "Now."
	<<else>>
		"Hand it over," <<he>> says. <<He>> holds out <<his>> hand.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Pay|Rent Pay]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Rent Refuse]]>><<def 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $baileyseduced isnot 1>>
		<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
			<<link [[Seduce|Rent Seduce]]>><<trauma 3>><</link>><<promiscuous2>><<gtrauma>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $uncomfortable.prostituting is false>>
			<<link [[Seduce|Rent Seduce]]>><<trauma 12>><<set $desperateaction to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous2>><<ggtrauma>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	/* Enclosing branch already proved the rent is affordable. Not while Bailey is relentless (takes cash only) or while the bank is collecting through them. */
	<<if ($syndromeBailey is true or $baileydefeated gte 5) and !(setup.inflation and setup.inflation.baileyAggressive()) and !setup.hbsc.hasLoan() and !(setup.inflation and setup.inflation.isEnabled() and ["extreme", "parody"].includes(setup.inflation.tierForWealth()?.id))>>
		<span class="bailey-red bailey-stockholm"><<link "Offer yourself" "Bailey Offer Yourself">><</link>></span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<person1>>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek">>
			"I-I don't have it," you admit, lowering your eyes towards the desk. "I can't pay you today."

		<<case "shy">>
			"I don't have the money, so I can't pay today," you say quietly, looking down rather than meeting Bailey's eyes.

		<<case "polite">>
			You keep your voice steady. "I'm sorry, but I don't have the money to pay you today."

		<<case "confident">>
			You stay where you are instead of shrinking back. "I don't have the money, and threatening me won't make it appear."

		<<case "bratty">>
			You stare back at <<him>>. "I don't have your money, and I wouldn't hand it over just because you're trying to scare me."

		<<case "docile">>
			"I don't have it, so I can't pay you today," you say, lowering your head while you wait for Bailey's response.

		<<case "flamboyant">>
			You keep your voice steady. "I'm sorry, but I don't have the money to pay you today."

		<<case "cruel">>
			You look <<him>> over without backing away. "I don't have your money, so find someone else to threaten if that's all you've got."
		<<default>>
			"I don't have the money, so I can't pay today," you tell <<him>>.

	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	<<rentnopay true>>
<</if>>
<<set $rentTime to 7>>

:: Bailey Strip Club Confront
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "connudatus">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set _why to $daily.baileyStripClub>>
<<unset $daily.baileyStripClub>>

You step out onto Connudatus Street. A hand suddenly lands on your shoulder. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
<br><br>

<<His>> date is nowhere to be found. It's only the two of you standing beneath the streetlight.
<br><br>

<<if _why is "rent">>
	"There you are," <<he>> says<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>> with a sneer<</if>>. "Rent's due, brat. You're coming with me."<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Go with <<him>>|Street Bailey Rent]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Run|Street Stalk Run Bailey]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $baileyMonogamous>> /* Only reachable if Bailey is straying. */
	<<if baileyWeeksMissed() gte 3>>
		"There you are. You little shit," <<he>> says in a low voice. <<Hes>> smiling, but <<his>> fingers tighten on your shoulder while <<he>> looks you over. "Is this fun for you? Wasting my time? Leading me on?"
	<<else>> /* 2+ weekends missed */
		"You little shit," <<he>> hisses at you below <<his>> breath. <<Hes>> smiling at you, but you can tell <<hes>> furious. "Do I need to remind you what you owe me?"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Bailey slides <<his>> hand from your shoulder to your upper arm and starts walking, pulling you into step beside <<him>> before you can plant your feet.
	<br><br>

	"My flat." <<He>> keeps moving as <<he>> says it. "Now."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Go with <<him>>|Bailey Flat Weekend Visit]]>><<baileySeenAdd "flatUnlock">><<set $baileyFlatDragged to true>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Bailey Strip Club Confront Refuse]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	For a long moment, neither of you speaks. The streetlight overhead flickers once while Bailey keeps <<his>> hand on your shoulder. <<His>> fingers tighten, and <<his>> lips pull back far enough to show <<his>> teeth before <<he>> quickly controls the expression.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
		"You're earning your keep," <<he>> says at last, letting you go. "Good. Rent's due on <<rentday>>."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> looks over you once before turning away.
	<<else>>
		"Rent's due on <<rentday>>." <<He>> lets you go, running that same hand through <<his>> hair and looking way from you. "Don't be late."
		<br><br>
	<</if>>	
	Bailey leaves you alone.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Strip Club Confront Refuse
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek">>
		You pull weakly against Bailey's grip. "N-no, I've already paid rent, and I don't want to go with you."

	<<case "shy">>
		You keep your voice low as you try to draw your arm back. "I've already paid rent, and I'm not going with you."

	<<case "polite">>
		You try to pull your arm free without raising your voice. "I've already paid rent, so I'm not going with you."

	<<case "confident">>
		You pull against <<his>> grip and face <<him>> directly. "Let go of me. I've paid rent, and I'm not going with you."

	<<case "bratty">>
		You try to wrench your arm out of <<his>> hand. "Hell no, asshole. I've already paid rent, and I'm not going anywhere with you."

	<<case "docile">>
		You do not raise your voice, but you still pull your arm back. "I've already paid rent, and I don't want to go with you."

	<<case "flamboyant">>
		You try to pull your arm free without raising your voice. "I've already paid rent, so I'm not going with you."

	<<case "cruel">>
		You wrench your arm against <<his>> grip. "Get your hand off me. I've paid you already, and I'm not going anywhere with you."
	<<default>>
		You tug your arm away from <<him>>. "I've already paid rent, and I'm not going anywhere with you."

<</switch>>
<br><br>
Bailey looks at you without answering. The corner of <<his>> mouth twists into a sneer as <<his>> grip tightens until it hurts.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

"Fine," <<he>> says at last. "You'll pay up, one way or the other." <<baileyBrat 4 "monogamy_refused">><<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><<ldom>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Orphanage Bailey Pounce
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
You crouch beside the coat stand, close to the wall, and wait for Bailey to leave <<his>> room.
<br><br>
Bailey's door opens. <<He>> steps into the hallway with a ledger tucked under one arm and starts walking towards you without noticing where you are hiding. You lower yourself closer to the floor as <<he>> approaches, watching <<his>> legs and waiting until <<hes>> close enough to reach.
<br><br>
<<if $physiqueSuccess or $danceSuccess>>
	As Bailey passes, you spring up and wrap both arms around <<his>> waist. Your momentum carries you into <<him>> before <<he>> can step away, knocking <<him>> off balance. The ledger slips from under <<his>> arm as Bailey goes down, and you land across <<him>> on the hallway floor.
	<br><br>
	For a moment Bailey only looks up at you. Then a short, surprised laugh escapes <<him>>, so quiet that you almost miss it.
	<br><br>
	"Get off me." <<He>> puts a hand against your shoulder and pushes until you move aside, then sits up and reaches for the fallen ledger. "Pick that up. And don't let anyone see you doing it."
	<<stress -12>><<llstress>><<trauma -6>><<ltrauma>><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<glove>><<transform cat 1>>
<<else>>
	As Bailey passes, you spring towards <<him>> and reach for <<his>> waist. <<He>> notices the movement in time to turn, bringing one hand up between you before you can get both arms around <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> palm catches the side of your head and knocks you sideways. Your shoulder hits the wall, and you have to brace yourself against it to stay on your feet.
	<br><br>
	"No." Bailey lowers <<his>> hand and continues down the hallway without waiting for you. "That's coming out of your rent."
	<<pain 8>><<ggpain>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><<baileyBrat 1 "pounce">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
